WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.072
Yes, that's absolutely possible.

2
00:00:06.408 --> 00:00:12.912
But since ordinary makeup lets the dark tattoo pigment show through, it needs a special covering process.

3
00:00:13.248 --> 00:00:22.104
First, a high-coverage foundation is used to essentially erase the brow area, then set firmly with translucent powder, repeating this at least two to three times.

4
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:29.544
Once the original tattoo is faded down like this, a new eyebrow design suited to your current hair color and face shape is drawn on top.

5
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:39.768
Since eyebrows shape more than 70 percent of your overall impression, just evening out an asymmetrical arch and softening the depth can transform your look.

6
00:00:40.104 --> 00:00:48.600
The real expertise lies in adjusting the intensity with the expectation that the tattoo may start showing through again as the makeup settles into the skin over time.

7
00:00:48.936 --> 00:00:56.640
Many wedding parents who worried about dark brow tattoos have gone through this correction process and said, with great satisfaction, "My whole look feels different."
